# FinTrust Digital Bank — Data Science Track
### AnalystLab Africa · Experience Lab Internship Programme

> A 4-week, end-to-end data science project for **FinTrust Digital Bank**, a fictional digital banking organisation built for the AnalystLab Africa Experience Lab. This repository documents my work on the **Data Science track**: turning raw customer and transaction data into a predictive risk-review model, from problem definition through to a final, validated, and documented solution.

**All customers, transactions, and financial information in this project are synthetic and used for educational purposes only.**

